      "text": "Dear team at Bader Philanthropies,\n\nComForce demo is a group of volunteers in Milwaukee. In November 2026 so far, we received 14 requests for help and helped with 9 of them. Our volunteers gave 312 hours, a value of $10,817 at $34.67 an hour.\n\nFor December 2026 to November 2027, our forecast for youth stipend information, community clean up and job search help is 131 to 214 jobs and 346 to 562 volunteer hours. Your page lists the next deadline as 30 November 2026.\n\nWe would like to ask whether ComForce demo may apply. Could we talk about the next steps?\n\nWith thanks,\nComForce demo\n\nSource: the Vision record for November 2026 so far, sealed at line 128. The forecast uses synthetic history.",
